      "position": 1,
      "content": "Note: The Bachelor of Arts in Music, Music Education Emphasis will be placed on moratorium. For detailed degree requirements, please consult the 2024-25 Catalog . Currently enrolled students have the option of finishing this degree or requesting a change of major to the Bachelor of Music, Music Teacher Preparation Concentration.",
